description:
Implement `MyPick<T, K extends keyof T>` — a mapped type that selects only the specified keys from `T` — without using the built-in `Pick<T, K>`.

Also implement `pickKeys<T, K extends keyof T>(obj: T, keys: K[]): MyPick<T, K>` that extracts those keys at runtime.

**Example:**
```ts
type User = { id: number; name: string; email: string };
type Preview = MyPick<User, 'id' | 'name'>;
// { id: number; name: string }
```

